 dir←CreateTempDir create;i;prefix;failed
⍝ New folders (739⌶0)/linktest-<n> and linktest-<n>-config. create=0: just find a free name.
⍝ Another session may grab the same <n> at the same time: ⎕MKDIR fails if the folder exists, so on failure try the next <n>.
 prefix←(739⌶0),'/linktest-' ⋄ i←failed←0
 :Repeat
     dir←prefix,⍕i←i+1
     :If ∨/⎕NEXISTS dir∘,¨'' '-config' ⋄ :Continue ⋄ :EndIf
     :If ~create ⋄ :Return ⋄ :EndIf
     :Trap 22
         2 ⎕MKDIR dir
         :Leave
     :Else
         :If 10≤failed←failed+1
             (⎕DMX.(EM,(×≢Message)/': ',Message))⎕SIGNAL 22
         :EndIf
     :EndTrap
 :EndRepeat
 2 ⎕MKDIR dir,'-config'
